plasmaar
========

plasmaar ports Solaar (https://github.com/pwr-Solaar/Solaar) to KDE Plasma. In the sense of the
GNU General Public License it is a modified version of Solaar.

Origin
  Solaar's master branch at commit e7304c4c (2026-08-17, "Align the colons in the solaar show
  device summary"), i.e. Solaar 1.1.20 plus 9 commits, with Solaar's complete git history.

Copyright
  Files inherited from Solaar keep their copyright and license notices (see COPYRIGHT and the
  file headers): Daniel Pavel, Peter Patel-Schneider and the Solaar contributors.
  Files added by plasmaar are Copyright (C) 2026 plasmaar contributors.

Changes
  Every file inherited from Solaar and modified by plasmaar carries this line in its header:
    Modified for plasmaar since 2026-10-02 (https://github.com/fredaime/plasmaar); dated changes: its git history.
  The git history of https://github.com/fredaime/plasmaar records each change and its date.
  Removed from Solaar: its udev rule files (replaced by rules.d/42-plasmaar.rules and
  rules.d/42-plasmaar-uinput.rules, derived from them) and its GitHub Pages deployment workflow.
  When you modify another file inherited from Solaar, add the same line to its header.

